PRODUCTION POSSIBILITY FRONTIER (PPF)
Society must decide, what to produce out of an almost
infinite range of possibilities.
As the choice is to be made between infinite possibilities,
the economists assumed a very basic economy with only two
goods (say, guns and butter).
It is ALSO called 'Production Possibility Frontier (PPE) or
Production Possibility Curve (PPC).
